@John_Westra I'd buy one if it were allowed, and so would a lot of other people because they're going to be cheaper than the American ones. A lot of people in robotics in San Francisco tell me it's about 1/20th the cost to make a humanoid robot in China compared to making it here in America. 

But yeah, if I were running a military thing, I would have to buy American. And I'm an American, so I have to buy American anyways. We'll wait for Elon to ship it, or I've already ordered a Neo. Who knows? 

Do I care that the CCP is listening to me? No, not really. But I know a lot of people do.

